# RX cloud layout rebake — 2026-09-15

The user's rearranged Study03 cloud layout has been recaptured and applied to
`/Game/RXSkySystem/Cubeless/Maps/L_RXSkySystem_Cubeless`.
The original source map SHA-256 is
`ad40ba7bab47190f2d333c3ba9c79e47aad831aae56040766a6a17cd6c467bcb`.
The frozen MPC differs from the previous bake in 51 vector parameters; scalar
parameters are unchanged. The fresh source is
`/Game/RXSkyBaking/Cubeless/Layouts/Study03_20260915/Materials/MI_CloudSource`.

## Completed result

- Bake: `Cubeless_RXPair2K_Rebake_20260915`, 528 captures, 480.92 seconds.
- Quality: 512 primary / 5 effective shadow samples, 2048-square faces, eight
  linear accumulations per face, 2048-square HDR output pair.
- RX channel layout, gain four and Positive-alpha edge filtering are preserved.
- Outputs: `/Game/RXSkySystem/Cubeless/Rebakes/Cubeless_RXPair2K_Rebake_20260915/Textures`.
- Existing cloud/shadow MICs reference the new pair. Fog-enabled parent, night
  visibility and dusk/night handoff shader are unchanged. Earlier textures remain.
- Editor returns to the user's original camera and 20:00 time after daylight QA.

## GPU failures and quality decision

The initial 1024/32 attempt stopped after 163 observed captures with
`DXGI_ERROR_DEVICE_HUNG` / Aftermath timeout. A 768/10 attempt also caused a GPU
hang. Neither produced an applied RX package. The user explicitly requested
lower quality and editor restart. The third capture used the previously completed
512/5 profile and completed successfully. Experimental high-quality code changes
were removed; no GPU timeout, OS watchdog or driver setting was changed.
Crash logs remain under `MCPGameProject/Saved/RXRebake_20260915`.

## Verification

- Full offline dispatcher: 42/42 pass in a separate same-repository candidate,
  with complete before/after input hashes and no unexpected changes.
- Live capture: 528/528, finite channels, restoration `ok`, full GPU mip residency
  checked before filtering and released afterward.
- Native cold load and time-of-day updates with UnrealMCP disabled: pass.
- Affected RX map Windows SM6 cook with UnrealMCP disabled: pass.
- Daylight and 20:00 editor screenshots reviewed. No PIE was required.
- Original editable Study03 layout preserved; no new commit or push in this task.

